{"video_id": "mxUWDxq46g4", "channel_id": "UCMhP6eGoVt5PqVFeS8Mwg1Q", "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T04:02:17.845379+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 3.8, "end_seconds": 6.4, "text": "Hi everyone."}, {"start_seconds": 6.68, "end_seconds": 11.2, "text": "So, welcome to episode two."}, {"start_seconds": 8.92, "end_seconds": 14.88, "text": "In the last video, we talked about ML"}, {"start_seconds": 11.2, "end_seconds": 17.44, "text": "Ops theory. Today we go hands-on."}, {"start_seconds": 14.88, "end_seconds": 19.52, "text": "By end of this video, you will have"}, {"start_seconds": 17.44, "end_seconds": 21.6, "text": "a real machine learning model which is"}, {"start_seconds": 19.52, "end_seconds": 25.24, "text": "running inside a Docker."}, {"start_seconds": 21.6, "end_seconds": 26.68, "text": "Serving predictions via REST API."}, {"start_seconds": 25.24, "end_seconds": 29.24, "text": "We used"}, {"start_seconds": 26.68, "end_seconds": 32.32, "text": "Python scikit-learn"}, {"start_seconds": 29.24, "end_seconds": 35.88, "text": "and fast API Docker"}, {"start_seconds": 32.32, "end_seconds": 35.88, "text": "to make this ML model."}, {"start_seconds": 37.96, "end_seconds": 44.48, "text": "So, here is the plan. Four steps. Step"}, {"start_seconds": 40.76, "end_seconds": 46.76, "text": "one, we train a machine learning model."}, {"start_seconds": 44.48, "end_seconds": 51.48, "text": "And save it to a disk."}, {"start_seconds": 46.76, "end_seconds": 53.56, "text": "Step two, wrap it inside a fast API to"}, {"start_seconds": 51.48, "end_seconds": 55.08, "text": "create the REST endpoint anyone can"}, {"start_seconds": 53.56, "end_seconds": 56.52, "text": "call."}, {"start_seconds": 55.08, "end_seconds": 58.8, "text": "Step three,"}, {"start_seconds": 56.52, "end_seconds": 61.4, "text": "we write a Dockerfile"}, {"start_seconds": 58.8, "end_seconds": 63.8, "text": "to package everything into a container."}, {"start_seconds": 61.4, "end_seconds": 67.68, "text": "Step four, we build the image, run it,"}, {"start_seconds": 63.8, "end_seconds": 67.68, "text": "and test the live API."}, {"start_seconds": 72.4, "end_seconds": 76.48, "text": "So, before writing any code, let's look"}, {"start_seconds": 74.48, "end_seconds": 79.8, "text": "at the project structure here. Five"}, {"start_seconds": 76.48, "end_seconds": 81.64, "text": "files, each one has"}, {"start_seconds": 79.8, "end_seconds": 83.48, "text": "a single job to do."}, {"start_seconds": 81.64, "end_seconds": 85.88, "text": "model.py"}, {"start_seconds": 83.48, "end_seconds": 90.04, "text": "trains our ML model and saves it to a"}, {"start_seconds": 85.88, "end_seconds": 91.76, "text": "disk. app.py with fast"}, {"start_seconds": 90.04, "end_seconds": 93.52, "text": "fast API server"}, {"start_seconds": 91.76, "end_seconds": 95.2, "text": "that loads the model and serves the"}, {"start_seconds": 93.52, "end_seconds": 97.48, "text": "predictions."}, {"start_seconds": 95.2, "end_seconds": 100.0, "text": "requirements.txt"}, {"start_seconds": 97.48, "end_seconds": 101.36, "text": "tells pip which which Python packages to"}, {"start_seconds": 100.0, "end_seconds": 103.52, "text": "install."}, {"start_seconds": 101.36, "end_seconds": 105.84, "text": "Dockerfile tells"}, {"start_seconds": 103.52, "end_seconds": 107.36, "text": "Docker how to package everything into a"}, {"start_seconds": 105.84, "end_seconds": 109.84, "text": "container."}, {"start_seconds": 107.36, "end_seconds": 112.04, "text": "And readme which is a documentation"}, {"start_seconds": 109.84, "end_seconds": 116.56, "text": "which is always a good practice."}, {"start_seconds": 112.04, "end_seconds": 119.08, "text": "So, you can notice how clean this is."}, {"start_seconds": 116.56, "end_seconds": 121.4, "text": "One file, one responsibility."}, {"start_seconds": 119.08, "end_seconds": 124.0, "text": "This how we write ML projects are"}, {"start_seconds": 121.4, "end_seconds": 124.0, "text": "structured."}, {"start_seconds": 126.56, "end_seconds": 131.76, "text": "Now, uh we'll"}, {"start_seconds": 128.32, "end_seconds": 131.76, "text": "go to model.py."}, {"start_seconds": 135.2, "end_seconds": 141.4, "text": "So, we import uh load Iris."}, {"start_seconds": 138.96, "end_seconds": 145.2, "text": "This gave us like 150 real flower"}, {"start_seconds": 141.4, "end_seconds": 147.52, "text": "measurement collected in 1936."}, {"start_seconds": 145.2, "end_seconds": 149.84, "text": "So, think of it as an opening at a"}, {"start_seconds": 147.52, "end_seconds": 152.16, "text": "spreadsheet with 150 rows"}, {"start_seconds": 149.84, "end_seconds": 154.32, "text": "of data, no intelligence yet."}, {"start_seconds": 152.16, "end_seconds": 155.76, "text": "Just numbers, raw numbers, and there is"}, {"start_seconds": 154.32, "end_seconds": 157.48, "text": "no"}, {"start_seconds": 155.76, "end_seconds": 159.84, "text": "uh machine learning yet."}, {"start_seconds": 157.48, "end_seconds": 162.68, "text": "So, we import uh random forest"}, {"start_seconds": 159.84, "end_seconds": 163.64, "text": "classifier. This is a pre-built uh"}, {"start_seconds": 162.68, "end_seconds": 166.8, "text": "uh"}, {"start_seconds": 163.64, "end_seconds": 168.32, "text": "library um algorithm. So, thousands of"}, {"start_seconds": 166.8, "end_seconds": 170.24, "text": "engineers built"}, {"start_seconds": 168.32, "end_seconds": 172.4, "text": "this for us, and we just import and use"}, {"start_seconds": 170.24, "end_seconds": 175.0, "text": "it inside our model."}, {"start_seconds": 172.4, "end_seconds": 177.72, "text": "So, then model.fit. This is a single"}, {"start_seconds": 175.0, "end_seconds": 179.4, "text": "line, uh we could say, uh where all the"}, {"start_seconds": 177.72, "end_seconds": 181.72, "text": "learning happens. Like,"}, {"start_seconds": 179.4, "end_seconds": 185.64, "text": "the algorithm studies all 150 rows,"}, {"start_seconds": 181.72, "end_seconds": 188.28, "text": "finds patterns, builds a decision trees."}, {"start_seconds": 185.64, "end_seconds": 190.24, "text": "After this line, the model knows how to"}, {"start_seconds": 188.28, "end_seconds": 191.68, "text": "predict flowers based on the inputs we"}, {"start_seconds": 190.24, "end_seconds": 194.52, "text": "provide."}, {"start_seconds": 191.68, "end_seconds": 197.96, "text": "So, finally, we save it using pickle."}, {"start_seconds": 194.52, "end_seconds": 199.4, "text": "So, we should save the model because"}, {"start_seconds": 197.96, "end_seconds": 202.84, "text": "every time"}, {"start_seconds": 199.4, "end_seconds": 203.56, "text": "we hit the API, you should not retrain"}, {"start_seconds": 202.84, "end_seconds": 205.4, "text": "uh"}, {"start_seconds": 203.56, "end_seconds": 206.68, "text": "retrain the model every time as we hit"}, {"start_seconds": 205.4, "end_seconds": 208.12, "text": "the API."}, {"start_seconds": 206.68, "end_seconds": 210.12, "text": "So, loading a"}, {"start_seconds": 208.12, "end_seconds": 212.32, "text": "loading a model saved takes"}, {"start_seconds": 210.12, "end_seconds": 214.48, "text": "milliseconds."}, {"start_seconds": 212.32, "end_seconds": 216.64, "text": "Uh so, that's ML Ops uh"}, {"start_seconds": 214.48, "end_seconds": 219.44, "text": "thinking right there."}, {"start_seconds": 216.64, "end_seconds": 220.68, "text": "So, run it, you should see a model saved"}, {"start_seconds": 219.44, "end_seconds": 224.56, "text": "uh dialog."}, {"start_seconds": 220.68, "end_seconds": 224.56, "text": "So, if you go to VS Code here,"}, {"start_seconds": 233.36, "end_seconds": 237.2, "text": "let"}, {"start_seconds": 234.76, "end_seconds": 237.2, "text": "Yep."}, {"start_seconds": 237.52, "end_seconds": 244.08, "text": "So, python 3 model.py"}, {"start_seconds": 241.64, "end_seconds": 247.16, "text": "This is the the command which we use to"}, {"start_seconds": 244.08, "end_seconds": 247.16, "text": "save the model first."}, {"start_seconds": 247.68, "end_seconds": 251.68, "text": "Yeah, you could see the model saved"}, {"start_seconds": 249.28, "end_seconds": 251.68, "text": "here."}, {"start_seconds": 251.76, "end_seconds": 256.36, "text": "So, then"}, {"start_seconds": 253.4, "end_seconds": 256.36, "text": "we built uh"}, {"start_seconds": 257.84, "end_seconds": 263.24, "text": "app.py now. So, if you see app.py"}, {"start_seconds": 262.32, "end_seconds": 266.76, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start_seconds": 263.24, "end_seconds": 269.4, "text": "So, app.py we create this fast API app"}, {"start_seconds": 266.76, "end_seconds": 269.4, "text": "online."}, {"start_seconds": 269.48, "end_seconds": 275.0, "text": "So, we load the saved model at startup."}, {"start_seconds": 272.12, "end_seconds": 277.52, "text": "This happens once, not every request."}, {"start_seconds": 275.0, "end_seconds": 279.36, "text": "So, this is very important in in terms"}, {"start_seconds": 277.52, "end_seconds": 281.92, "text": "of performance"}, {"start_seconds": 279.36, "end_seconds": 286.88, "text": "of the model itself."}, {"start_seconds": 281.92, "end_seconds": 289.6, "text": "The predict endpoints takes the four uh"}, {"start_seconds": 286.88, "end_seconds": 290.84, "text": "of four uh"}, {"start_seconds": 289.6, "end_seconds": 292.92, "text": "What do you say?"}, {"start_seconds": 290.84, "end_seconds": 295.48, "text": "float parameters"}, {"start_seconds": 292.92, "end_seconds": 297.4, "text": "which directly measures the measure of"}, {"start_seconds": 295.48, "end_seconds": 300.24, "text": "flower actually."}, {"start_seconds": 297.4, "end_seconds": 302.2, "text": "So, fast API reads them automatically"}, {"start_seconds": 300.24, "end_seconds": 304.48, "text": "and validates them. If you send a wrong"}, {"start_seconds": 302.2, "end_seconds": 305.68, "text": "type, the fast API rejects and no extra"}, {"start_seconds": 304.48, "end_seconds": 308.84, "text": "code is nee